NOTICE
======

luna is distributed under the Mozilla Public License 2.0 (see LICENSE). It
was written by studying two open-source emulators, ares and Mesen2, and some
of its files say, in their own headers or comments, that they port or follow
code, tables, formats or behaviour of one of them. This file states the
licence of each origin and lists those files. It makes no judgement on what
the licences require of luna; it is the inventory the triage works from.

The list is built from what the files declare about themselves (a search of
the tree for "port", "verbatim", "translated" and "Mesen2's" next to the
name of a reference). A file that ports without saying so is not in it.


