3. Withdrawn
------------

crates/luna-api/src/event_viewer.rs and the GUI Event Viewer panel, which
said they were ported verbatim from Mesen2, have been removed from the tip of
the repository (they remain in the git history, which has not been rewritten)
until they are rewritten clean-room.
